| Element | Value |
|---------|-------|
| **Plugin Name** | `power_geojson` |
| **Identity** | GeoJSON/Esri JSON rendering on Flutter maps |
| **Existing Icon** | Globe wrapped in `{ }` JSON curly braces |
| **Flutter Brand Blue** | `#027DFD` |
