## Prompt 3 — README Banner / Hero Image

```
A wide banner image (1280×640px) for a GitHub README. Dark background (#0D1117).

Left side: the Power GeoJSON logomark (Flutter bird merged with geo wireframe, blue tones).
Right side: a stylized code snippet showing Dart/Flutter code in a minimal code editor frame — syntax-highlighted with blue keywords, orange strings, white identifiers — the code reads something like:
  PowerGeoJSONPolygons.asset(
    'assets/map.geojson',
    polygonProperties: PolygonProperties(
      color: Colors.blue,
    ),
  );

Between the logo and code: subtle map grid lines or coordinate dots fading into the background, connecting the two halves.

Bottom: the text "power_geojson" in JetBrains Mono, 24px, white (#E6EDF3), with a small "for Flutter" tagline in muted gray (#8B949E) below it.

Style: minimal, dev-tool aesthetic, dark mode, no busy patterns. Think Vercel or Supabase README banners.
```

