## 📋 Font & Color Quick Reference

### Fonts
| Usage | Font | Weight |
|-------|------|--------|
| UI headings | **Inter** | Semi-Bold (600) |
| UI body | **Inter** | Regular (400) |
| Code / badges | **JetBrains Mono** or **Fira Code** | Regular (400) |
| Logo text (if any) | **JetBrains Mono** | Medium (500) |

### Color Palette
| Name | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| **Background** | `#0D1117` | App/page background (dark) |
| **Surface** | `#161B22` | Cards, bottom sheets |
| **Flutter Blue** | `#027DFD` | Primary brand, buttons, accents |
| **Geo Blue Fill** | `#2195F3` | Polygon fills (40% opacity) |
| **Geo Blue Border** | `#1E00FD` | Polygon/polyline borders |
| **Polyline Orange** | `#FF9800` | Polylines, route accents |
| **Marker Red** | `#F44336` | Map pins, alert accents |
| **Indigo** | `#3F51B5` | Circle overlays, secondary |
| **Text Primary** | `#E6EDF3` | Headings, labels (dark mode) |
| **Text Secondary** | `#8B949E` | Descriptions, muted text |
| **White** | `#FFFFFF` | Light mode background |
| **Light Surface** | `#F6F8FA` | Light mode cards |
